# ---------------------------------------------------------------- datasets
# None of the raw or preprocessed data belongs in git: GitHub rejects single
# files over 100 MB, and all of it is re-creatable from the scripts in this repo.
#
#   ixi/    447 MB  IXI Tiny, Mendeley release 7kd5wj7v7p-3
#   isic/   3.4 GB  ISIC 2019 jpgs + the uint8 cache
#                   -> python -m cfl_isic_client.download_preprocess
#   cache/  374 MB  preprocessed IXI volumes (rebuilt automatically on first run)
#
# brca/ (150 KB, ships with FLamby) and heart/ (40 KB, from UCI via
# `python -m cfl_heart_disease_client.download`) are small enough to keep.
ixi/
isic/
cache/

# -------------------------------------------------------- run artefacts
# Model checkpoints; the logs, metrics.csv, rounds.jsonl and final.json
# in results_*/ are small and ARE tracked.
results_*/**/models/
*.pt
*.pth

# similarity matrices can be a few MB each; keep them unless they bloat the repo
# results_*/**/similarities.npz

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- misc
*.tgz
*.zip
.DS_Store
